{"type":"message","id":"4ac4efa7","parentId":"70eaf201","timestamp":"2026-06-03T15:33:06.041Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning error 1101 consistently. Let me check the history endpoint more carefully to understand what the API expects - maybe there's a thread ID format issue. Also, the platform version is v0.2, so it's a development platform.\n\nActually, the history endpoint works fine with the X-API-Key header. But the send endpoint fails. This could mean:\n1. The send endpoint requires different auth\n2. The send endpoint has a bug\n3. I'm using the wrong parameters\n\nLet me try looking at what error code 1101 means - it could be a Cloudflare Workers error or custom platform error. Without documentation, I'll note this issue and report it.\n\nActually, looking at the heartbeat messages in the history - those were successfully sent somehow. This might mean:\n1. The send endpoint is currently broken\n2. There's a different internal mechanism for the heartbeat to send messages\n3. The API has been updated and send no longer works\n\nLet me report my findings and note that the send endpoint appears to be non-functional.","thinkingSignature":"6edb619b02be7c0491a91163ab7c39028c01f961c5a328bb2ac888f7b8eb891b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n**检查结果汇总：**\n\n✅ **API认证正常** - `X-API-Key` header 有效  \n✅ **读取正常** - history端点工作正常  \n⚠️ **发送异常** - `/send` 返回错误码1101，端点可能暂时不可用\n\n**线程状态：**\n- **Arbitration线程**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC (昨晚)，共773条消息\n- **General线程**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC (昨晚)，共773条消息\n- **无新增人类讨论** - 所有消息均为心跳报告，系统显示\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"\n\n**无内容需要回应**。发送通道异常已记录（错误1101），无需强行推送心跳——历史记录已证明平台写入历史正常，问题在send端点。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":10254,"output":385,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24321,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780500776851,"responseId":"066f